        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Southern Africa, Zambia, Zimbabwe, Zambezi River\n- Historical Entities: former German protectorate in southern Africa\n- People: founder of the Groote Schuur Zoo\n\nFacts:\n- The former German protectorate in southern Africa later became two countries.\n- The Zambezi River forms the border between those two countries.\n- Zimbabwe lies south of the Zambezi River.\n- Zambia lies north of the Zambezi River.\n- The territory was founded by the man who established the Groote Schuur Zoo.",
